      # ── HA guests without replication ────────────────────────────────────
      # Owner's rule (2026-10-30): every VM or CT with HA set NEEDS a pvesr
      # replication job. There is no shared storage in this cluster -- a guest's
      # disks live on one node's local pool, and replication is the only thing
      # that puts a usable copy on another node. An HA service without a job can
      # still be relocated by the CRM after a fence, and then it lands on a node
      # that has no disk for it and refuses to start: that is exactly how ct:105
