          description: "The last successful ha-backup-push run is older than 2 days (or the metric is missing). On hermes-gw-01: `systemctl status ha-backup-push.timer`, `journalctl -u ha-backup-push.service -n 50`, then run it by hand with `systemctl start ha-backup-push.service`. Common causes: HAOS SSH key rejected, rclone OAuth token expired, or /backup on the HA box full."
