      # Home Assistant Green eMMC wear. The device runs everything (config,
      # recorder DB, backups) on one soldered 32 GB eMMC; the kernel publishes a
      # JEDEC lifetime estimate that roles/../scripts/ha/ha_emmc_health.py samples
      # every 6 h. 0x04 at install time == 30% of rated write life consumed, so
      # 80% is the point where replacing the box starts to deserve planning.
      - uid: ha_emmc_wear_high
