          description: "The HA Green's soldered eMMC reports a JEDEC lifetime estimate at or above 80%. It still works, but plan the replacement (or an off-box recorder database) before it goes read-only. Check the trend with `ha_emmc_life_used_percent` in VictoriaMetrics; the raw counter is /sys/block/mmcblk0/device/life_time on the HA host."
